    # game/officescreen.rpy:963
    old "{size=25}{b}  Board Satisfaction{/b}{/size}{size=20} is arguably the most important stat in {i}Academy: Live!{/i} It determines how well you are doing your job and how pleased the Board of Directors are in keeping you as Chief Academic Officer.\n\n  Keep them happy, and you will keep your job!\n\n  Keep in mind that the board satisfaction will decay over time as well. That decay is a representation of the Board's desire to keep the students more and more corrupted. It will decay slowly at the beginning, but this decay will increase over time.\n\n  Board Satisfaction can also be used as a form of currency, for exchanging favors with the board, getting new perks for the Academy, or as a requirement for some scenes."
    new "{size=25}{b}  看板满意度{/b}{/size}{size=20}可以说是 {i}学院：生存！{/i} 中最重要的数值。它决定了你的工作做得有多好，以及理事会是否愿意继续留任你担任教务主任。\n\n  让他们保持满意，你就能保住这份工作！\n\n  另外请记住，看板满意度也会随时间衰减。这种衰减代表着理事会希望学生变得更加堕落的意愿。一开始衰减得很慢，但随着时间推移会越来越快。\n\n  看板满意度也可以当作一种货币，用来与理事会交换人情、为学院换取新的特权，或是满足某些场景的触发条件。"

    # game/officescreen.rpy:971
    old "{size=25}{b}  Students Trust{/b}{/size}{size=20} is the stat that dictates the trust the students have in the Academy and how the Academy treats them.\n\n  It has a heavy dependency on Students Grades and their Perversion Level. If the students grades drop too low, they'll blame it on the Academy being too difficult or unfair. And also, if they keep getting forced into some unwanted sexual situations, they might start to dislike the Academy.\n\n  However, if their perversion level is high enough, they might start to expect and look forward to said sexual situations, and they might increase their trust in the Academy."
    new "{size=25}{b}  学生的信任{/b}{/size}{size=20}决定了学生对学院的信任程度，以及学院对待她们的方式。\n\n  它与学生的成绩和堕落度高度相关。如果学生成绩掉得太低，她们会抱怨学院太难或太不公平。而且，如果她们不断被迫卷入一些并不情愿的性场合，也可能开始厌恶学院。\n\n  但如果她们的堕落度足够高，就可能会开始期待、甚至盼望那些性场合，她们对学院的信任反而会提升。"

    # game/officescreen.rpy:979
    old "{size=25}{b}  Academic Performance{/b}{/size}{size=20} determines how well the students are performing in their academics. It is a combination of their overall progress from all of the Academy Disciplines.\n\n  This stat can be manipulated and used as a currency in order to make the students perform some activities in exchange for an increase in this stat."
    new "{size=25}{b}  学业表现{/b}{/size}{size=20}决定了学生们的学业表现如何。它综合了她们在所有学院学科上的总体进度。\n\n  这个数值可以被操弄，也可以当作货币，用来让学生们以某些活动来换取该数值的提升。"

    # game/officescreen.rpy:987
    old "{size=25}{b}  Academic Perversion Level{/b}{/size}{size=20} is the stat that determines the level of sexual corruption of those that attend the Academy.\n\n  The higher this value, the more willing the students (and some members of the staff) will be into performing more and more perverted sexual acts."
    new "{size=25}{b}  学业淫乱度{/b}{/size}{size=20}是决定就读于学院的学生性堕落程度的数值。\n\n  这个数值越高，学生（以及部分教职员工）就越愿意进行更加淫秽的性行为。"

    # game/officescreen.rpy:995
    old "{size=25}{b}  Outside Pressure{/b}{/size}{size=20} is how much information, of what is happening inside the Academy, is leaking to the outside knowledge.\n\n  Since the Board wishes to keep the Project in secrecy, this is a negative stat and should be kept to a minimum.\n\n  Usually, this stat increases if many public acts are performed, if students are mistreated or due to story reasons."
    new "{size=25}{b}  外部压力{/b}{/size}{size=20}表示学院内部发生的事情有多少泄漏到了外界。\n\n  由于理事会希望该项目保持机密，这是一个负面数值，应当压到最低。\n\n  通常，当公开性质的举动过多、学生遭到虐待，或出于剧情原因时，这个数值会上升。"

    # game/officescreen.rpy:1003
    old "{size=25}{b}  Lawsuit Progress{/b}{/size}{size=20} determines the progress of the Lawsuit that [mi] has started against [mc].\n\n  If this stat gets too high, there might be some negative consequences.\n\n  Luckily, the board has enough resources and connections to keep this Lawsuit in check, all you have to do is make sure you keep them happy."
